        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Estorninho. Bandos de Starly percorrem montanhas e campos em busca de Pokémon inseto. Seu canto é muito barulhento. Sozinho, ele é fraco, mas grupos grandes demais acabam brigando entre si.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/8 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Voador &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Starly pode evoluir para Staravia no nível 5 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Wing Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Double Team</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Endeavor</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Whirlwind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Aerial Ace</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Agility</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Brave Bird</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Final Gambit</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Agility, Air Cutter, Air Slash, Attract, Brave Bird, Confide, Defog, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dual Wingbeat, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Feather Dance, Fly, Frustration, Giga Impact, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hurricane, Ominous Wind, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Sleep Talk, Snore, Steel Wing, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, U-turn, Uproar, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Astonish, Detect, Double-Edge, Feather Dance, Foresight, Fury Attack, Mirror Move, Pursuit, Revenge, Roost, Sand Attack, Steel Wing, Uproar</p>",
